fers from around the world to meet, connect, and experience Laguna Golf Lăng Cô, one of Central Vietnam’s leading golf destinations. Continuing to Connect Golf with Community Initiatives One of the defining aspects of the Cobra Puma Pro-Am is its commitment to fundraising, which has remained an integral part of the event across multiple editions. In 2025, the tournament raised more than VND 2 billion, with proceeds donated to the Understanding the Heart Foundation and the Kianh Foundation’s centre for children with disabilities in Điện Bàn. The funds supported congenital heart surgery for children, while also contributing to facilities and educational activities for children with disabilities. Over the years, the tournament has become an annual gathering for the golf and business communities, while creating a meaningful model that brings together sport and social initiatives. Looking Ahead to the Competition at Laguna Lăng Cô Returning in early September, Cobra Puma Pro-Am 2026 is set to deliver another exciting edition of competition at Laguna Golf Lăng Cô, alongside a range of activities for participating golfers and guests. The three-day tournament from 4–6 September 2026 will be the highlight of the event, as Pro-Am teams compete for the best possible results on Laguna Golf Lăng Cô’s coastal golf course. More than a competition between teams, Cobra Puma Pro-Am continues to foster a connected golfing community where players can compete, build relationships, and contribute to meaningful community initiatives. Share the Post: Explore More Cobra Puma Pro-Am 2026 will take place from 4–6 September at Laguna Golf Lăng Cô, bringing together golfers from Vietnam and around the world.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCotton On Vincom Center Đồng Khởi | Vincom (https://vincom.com.vn/store/cotton-on-vincom-center-dong-khoi)\nciteturn327search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 14.5 years ago; Crawled: last week; Content type: text